{
  "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang",
  "chapter": 2,
  "act": 2,
  "scene": "zhaoyang",
  "palette": "gold",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "hetaihou",
    "songhuizhen",
    "peizhaoye"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "宋不拿照料换无限留任，裴接受已经耽误的去路不能补许",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "数日后，宋蕙贞来辞一项夜值。殿门风吹得披帛垂到椅脚。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l2",
      "who": "hetaihou",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "披着。夜里风硬。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l3",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "谢太后。夜值仍请换人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l4",
      "who": "hetaihou",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这些人你最熟。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l5",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我带新来的人做两回。往后她熟，我就不用每一夜都在了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l6",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "太后压住将被风卷走的一角，没替她重新披紧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l7",
      "who": "hetaihou",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "当年我留你，是怕她们一换人就减了饭药。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l8",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "饭药的数可以留下，我的人不能也留成一个数，少一夜便说要坏事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l9",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "换班与支给分开记。她肯带两回，不是应下往后的每一夜。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l10",
      "who": "hetaihou",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "把新值名与交接日给我。披帛拿走。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l11",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这个我拿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l12",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "宋告退后，裴照夜奉召交回军需核单，停在殿门内。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l13",
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她不去了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l14",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "转粮那一队？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l15",
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这回已定了别人。她另接修具的差，不等我再问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l16",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你怎么答？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l17",
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "应得的俸补齐。那两个暂缓，仍署我的名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l18",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "裴展开手中的核单，边角磨出了毛，里面没有那个人的新申请。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l19",
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她来问的时候，我说天暖了再去。如今真暖了，我倒找不到一句该对她说的话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l20",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不必叫她再申请一次。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l21",
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不叫。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l22",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "裴交出核单。门外牵马的人先行，她没有跟上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l23",
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我今日早一刻交完，想把这一刻给你。你有事，我就在这儿等风小些。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l24",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不要去点卯？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l25",
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "已点过。这一刻是我的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s14_zhaoyang.l26",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她站到风来的那一侧，却没替你决定往哪儿走。"
    }
  ],
